@startuml sequence_diagram

actor User
participant CalculatorCLI
participant CalculatorService
participant MemoryService
participant StatisticsService
participant FilterService
participant Calculator
participant JsonStorage

== Calculation Flow with Memory ==
User -> CalculatorCLI: run_interactive() or run_command()
activate CalculatorCLI

CalculatorCLI -> CalculatorService: perform_with_memory(operation, a, b)
activate CalculatorService

note over CalculatorService: start_time = perf_counter()

CalculatorService -> Calculator: calculate(operation, a, b)
activate Calculator
Calculator --> CalculatorService: result
deactivate Calculator

note over CalculatorService: end_time = perf_counter()\ncreate ResultEntry with execution_time_ms

CalculatorService -> JsonStorage: save(memory_entry)
activate JsonStorage
JsonStorage --> CalculatorService: saved
deactivate JsonStorage

CalculatorService --> CalculatorCLI: MemoryEntry
deactivate CalculatorService

CalculatorCLI -> User: show result
deactivate CalculatorCLI

== Memory Retrieve Flow ==
User -> CalculatorCLI: --memory-retrieve flag
activate CalculatorCLI

CalculatorCLI -> MemoryService: retrieve()
activate MemoryService

MemoryService -> JsonStorage: load_memory_all()
activate JsonStorage
JsonStorage --> MemoryService: list[MemoryEntry]
deactivate JsonStorage

MemoryService --> CalculatorCLI: list[MemoryEntry]
deactivate MemoryService

CalculatorCLI -> User: display memory history
deactivate CalculatorCLI

== Memory Store Flow ==
User -> CalculatorCLI: --memory-store OP [--result R | --error MSG]
activate CalculatorCLI

CalculatorCLI -> MemoryService: store(entry)
activate MemoryService

MemoryService -> JsonStorage: save(memory_entry)
activate JsonStorage
JsonStorage --> MemoryService: saved
deactivate JsonStorage

MemoryService --> CalculatorCLI: done
deactivate MemoryService

CalculatorCLI -> User: confirm stored
deactivate CalculatorCLI

== Filter Flow ==
User -> CalculatorCLI: --filter-op OP [--filter-state STATE] or interactive menu
activate CalculatorCLI

CalculatorCLI -> MemoryService: filter_entries(operation, state)
activate MemoryService

MemoryService -> JsonStorage: load_memory_all()
activate JsonStorage
JsonStorage --> MemoryService: list[MemoryEntry]
deactivate JsonStorage

MemoryService -> FilterService: filter_entries(entries, operation, state)
activate FilterService
FilterService --> MemoryService: filtered list[MemoryEntry]
deactivate FilterService

MemoryService --> CalculatorCLI: filtered results
deactivate MemoryService

CalculatorCLI -> User: display filtered entries
deactivate CalculatorCLI

== Statistics Flow ==
User -> CalculatorCLI: --statistics flag or interactive menu option
activate CalculatorCLI

CalculatorCLI -> StatisticsService: compute_statistics()
activate StatisticsService

StatisticsService -> MemoryService: retrieve()
activate MemoryService

MemoryService -> JsonStorage: load_memory_all()
activate JsonStorage
JsonStorage --> MemoryService: list[MemoryEntry]
deactivate JsonStorage

MemoryService --> StatisticsService: list[MemoryEntry]
deactivate MemoryService

note over StatisticsService: compute operation counts\ncount errors\ncalculate error rate\ncompute average execution time

StatisticsService --> CalculatorCLI: Statistics object
deactivate StatisticsService

CalculatorCLI -> User: display statistics
deactivate CalculatorCLI

@enduml
